text.paragraph:
Step 2. Shake Ampule: Shake ampule vigorously until the contents are thoroughly mixed (see 
   Figure A
).   The contents will appear cloudy and yellow to pale yellow in color.

Step 3. Open Ampule: Carefully twist open the top of the ampule and use the contents right away (see 
   Figure B
).

Step 4. Add Medicine: Squeeze all the medicine from the ampule into the nebulizer cup (reservoir) (see 
   Figure C
).

Step 5. Attach Mouthpiece: If a separate mouthpiece attachment is supplied with your nebulizer, connect the mouthpiece to the nebulizer (see 
   Figure D
).

Step 6. Connect the Nebulizer to the Compressor: Firmly insert one end of the tubing to the compressor. Insert the other end of the tubing to the bottom of the nebulizer cup (reservoir) (see 
   Figure E
).

Step 7. Prepare for Treatment: Sit in a comfortable, upright position. Place the mouthpiece in your mouth and close your lips around the mouthpiece (see 
   Figure F
).
